<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29305" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĭtella</span></b> , ae, f.
		dim.
		mitra, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a headband</i>, a kind of <i>turban</i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nobiles adulescentes Neapoli cum
					mitellā saepe vidimus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rab. Post. 10, 26</span></i>
			 (dub.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">copa Syrisca caput Graia redimita mitella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg. Cop. 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mitellā textili contecto capite,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 147</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mitellis et crocotis et carbasinis et
					bombycinis injecti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8</span></i>
			, p. 214, 5.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a bandage</i> for
			the arm, <i><span class="en">Cels. 8, 10, 3</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
